WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.024 --> 00:00:16.884
No one is looking.

2
00:00:17.505 --> 00:00:18.546
It's safe to come out.

3
00:00:18.566 --> 00:00:22.769
Bello: I can't believe your art teacher called me ugly!

4
00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:25.531
Tina: It was pretty funny.

5
00:00:25.551 --> 00:00:28.914
Bello: I guess you’re right.

6
00:00:29.635 --> 00:00:30.736
It was pretty funny.

7
00:00:31.208 --> 00:00:34.731
Bello: Where are we?

8
00:00:35.592 --> 00:00:36.733
Tina: This is Brad's house.

9
00:00:37.353 --> 00:00:39.935
Danny and Brad always play in Brad's garage.

10
00:00:39.955 --> 00:00:42.437
Bello: Good thinking.

11
00:00:43.018 --> 00:00:44.359
There might be a clue there.

12
00:00:44.379 --> 00:00:47.061
Tina: Okay, time to cover up again.

13
00:00:47.081 --> 00:00:53.586
Mom: Hello, dear.

14
00:00:53.826 --> 00:00:54.427
How are you?

15
00:00:54.447 --> 00:00:56.248
Tina: I'm good, thank you.

16
00:00:56.268 --> 00:00:58.530
Mom: What's in the wagon?

17
00:00:58.550 --> 00:01:00.792
Tina: It's a school project.

18
00:01:01.428 --> 00:01:03.569
We have to do it during summer vacation.

19
00:01:03.589 --> 00:01:05.449
Mom: I see.

20
00:01:05.869 --> 00:01:07.470
That looks like a big project.

21
00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:11.031
Tina: Yes, it takes a lot of imagination.

22
00:01:12.291 --> 00:01:12.971
Is Brad home?

23
00:01:12.991 --> 00:01:16.653
Mom: No, Brad hasn't come home from school yet.

24
00:01:17.633 --> 00:01:18.793
I think he's with Danny.

25
00:01:18.813 --> 00:01:24.095
Tina: Um Brad and I are doing our school project together.

26
00:01:24.115 --> 00:01:28.156
Tina: He said I could borrow some paintbrushes from your garage.

27
00:01:29.172 --> 00:01:30.192
Mom: Of course, Tina.

28
00:01:30.472 --> 00:01:31.573
The garage is open.

29
00:01:32.253 --> 00:01:32.973
Help yourself.

30
00:01:33.673 --> 00:01:34.353
Tina: Awesome.

31
00:01:34.674 --> 00:01:35.314
Thanks, Mrs.

32
00:01:35.374 --> 00:01:43.316
Joseph. Tina: She's gone.

33
00:01:43.616 --> 00:01:44.216
It's safe.

34
00:01:44.236 --> 00:01:45.636
Bello: Great.

35
00:01:45.977 --> 00:01:48.617
I'll be glad not to be an art project for a while.

36
00:01:48.637 --> 00:01:54.659
Tina: Oops.

37
00:01:54.919 --> 00:01:56.339
Don't forget your disguise!

38
00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:08.322
Tina: Well, they were definitely here not too long ago.

39
00:02:08.342 --> 00:02:11.603
Bello: There’s something strange about this room.

40
00:02:12.004 --> 00:02:14.145
Look. Tina: That's weird.

41
00:02:14.745 --> 00:02:16.606
All those things are the wrong size.

42
00:02:17.607 --> 00:02:18.267
Bello: I know.

43
00:02:18.547 --> 00:02:20.548
But the small ones interest me more.

44
00:02:22.469 --> 00:02:23.870
Look how tiny it is.

45
00:02:23.890 --> 00:02:27.132
Tina: Yeah, it's very tiny.

46
00:02:27.152 --> 00:02:31.234
Bello: Why would you want to make something so small?

47
00:02:31.254 --> 00:02:34.756
Tina: "Cut them down to size."

48
00:02:36.076 --> 00:02:39.717
Tina: Brad told me that Danny wanted to cut Chuck and Dave down to size.

49
00:02:39.737 --> 00:02:41.858
Tina: They are the bullies.

50
00:02:41.878 --> 00:02:44.998
Bello: He wanted to shrink them?

51
00:02:45.419 --> 00:02:46.019
But how?

52
00:02:46.039 --> 00:02:49.920
Tina: Brad's father works in a top secret factory.

53
00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:54.761
Tina: Maybe they found something in here Bello: And used it to shrink them!

54
00:02:55.521 --> 00:02:57.342
Tina: That's terrible!

55
00:02:57.362 --> 00:03:00.383
Bello: I hope it’s not too late to stop them.

56
00:03:01.383 --> 00:03:03.803
Tina: Danny and Brad were waiting for them after school.

57
00:03:04.884 --> 00:03:05.404
Oh no!

58
00:03:07.084 --> 00:03:07.644
Bello: Quickly!

59
00:03:07.945 --> 00:03:09.606
We have to go to the schoolyard!

60
00:03:10.887 --> 00:03:14.870
Tina: God, you’re heavy!

61
00:03:15.871 --> 00:03:17.172
We need to go faster!

62
00:03:17.192 --> 00:03:19.313
Bello: I've got an idea.

63
00:03:19.994 --> 00:03:20.674
Start running!

64
00:03:22.315 --> 00:03:25.078
Tina: Great idea, Bello!

65
00:03:25.098 --> 00:03:27.740
Bello: Thanks!
